<title>ITALY: Italy's Gemina signs HPI spinoff deal.</title>
<headline>Italy's Gemina signs HPI spinoff deal.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian financial holding Gemina Spa said it on Monday formally signed the contract spinning off its industrial activities setting up a holding company called HPI.</p>
<p>HPI's full name is Holding di Partecipazioni Industriali SpA.</p>
<p>A Gemina statement said a nine-member board had been named for HPI, with Nicolo Nefri appointed as Chairman.</p>
